      "statement": "When a local easysam.yaml contains a lambda definition, EasySAM extracts the name, registers it in functions (error on duplicates), derives uri from the file's directory if not set, creates an API Gateway path entry from integration (error on duplicate paths), and promotes functionurl, timeout, memory, and schedule into the function resource.",
